<h2 id="orange-county-kitchen-design-trends">Orange County Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Orange County kitchens favor a light, coastal-transitional palette — white and warm-white perimeters, white-oak and walnut islands, natural textures, and easy indoor-outdoor flow. The high-end coastal enclaves of Newport Beach, Corona del Mar, and Laguna increasingly pair this with handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> and seamless <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> kitchens for a more contemporary, gallery-like feel.</p>
